Z||000005||Jay||05-07-2001||06:09 PM||||A simple way to find out is to phone any dealership and give them your VIN number.  By punching it in on their computer they will know if the recall has been done.  If it hasn't they are obliged to do it, no matter how long it has been.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/jaygrande" TARGET=_blank>www.members.home.net/jaygrande</A> ||||reg||1
